<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian 42-day T-bill sold at average 11.6822 pct.</title>
<headline>Nigerian 42-day T-bill sold at average 11.6822 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's Central Bank said on Friday it sold 4,023 million naira worth of 42-day treasury bills carrying a weighted average rate of 11.6822 percent.</p>
<p>Bids totalled 4,023 million naira and the true yield will be 11.8592 percent.</p>
<p>Last week's sales were 2,070 million naira worth of 42-day treasury bills at a weighted average rate of 11.6659 percent.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 19 43</p>
</text>
